{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 1 cent per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. The live state of each instrument: mark, index, basis in bps, funding rate and next funding time, top of book spread, 24h volume, feed health and age. Optional instrument id. Carries meta (contentHash, validUntil) so freshness can tell you when nothing changed",
